  "G28: per head ratio of cost.BANDS (bolt k/d and s/d, nut s/d and m/d), artifact and side, catalogue rows with the ratio field at the first value on its 0.1 mm form step strictly below the band's low edge x d (outband-*-below-*) or strictly above its high edge x d (outband-*-above-*) that the walls and the shipped rule admit: the one with the largest enveloped edge ratio (R27's rank, a tie to the label) and the first in file order, one point when they coincide",
